    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0009-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:02:32.982+09:00">最初创造人的生命的,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:02:39.729+09:00">是天：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:02:47.844+09:00">培养人们成人的.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:02:50.873+09:00">是人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:03:09.528+09:00">能培养天生的人而不触犯其生长的，这种人可以做天子</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:03:28.593+09:00">天子的一举一动•</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:03:38.51+09:00">是以保全天生的人作为要事的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:04:03.626+09:00">这是我立官吏的来由•</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:04:18.545+09:00">设立官吏的目的是为r保全人的天性.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:04:29.43+09:00">如今世上昏翻勺君主，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:05:06.697+09:00">设立很多官吏反而危害人的天性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:05:33.953+09:00">那就失去了官的本来意义。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:05:37.259+09:00">这好象建立军队、</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:05:57.655+09:00">口的是为了防备敌寇入侵.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:06:01.974+09:00">如今建立军队，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:06:25.213+09:00">那就失去建立军队的意义了.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:07:03.753+09:00">水的本性足清的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:07:34.005+09:00">泥把它揽混.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:07:40.822+09:00">所以不得淸，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:07:49.601+09:00">人的天性是长寿的.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:07:55.717+09:00">外物扰乱他，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:08:00.675+09:00">所以不能得到应有的寿命。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:08:05.107+09:00">外物</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:08:08.85+09:00">是用来培养人的天性的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:09:51.739+09:00">人们不该损害天性去追求它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:09:55.374+09:00">如今世卜糊汾的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:10:01.385+09:00">大多追求外物来损害天性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:18:01.052+09:00">那就不懂得輕重了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:18:19.463+09:00">不知輕重</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:18:29.533+09:00">这样，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:16:36.511+09:00">就把重的当作轻的. </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:17:07.073+09:00">把轻的当作重的 </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:18:39.229+09:00">每行行动无不失败。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:18:50.181+09:00">以此来做国君，就是昏君；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:19:29.091+09:00">从此来做臣子,就是乱臣：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:19:36.209+09:00">以此来做儿子，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:19:59.001+09:00">就是狂妄之子以上三种情況，国内如果出现其中一神，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:20:10.908+09:00">就一定灭亡，绝不能幸免.、</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:21:05.482+09:00">如果行一种声音</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:21:32.127+09:00">耳朵听了肯定惬意.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:21:44.062+09:00">但听过之后就侵人耳聋，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:21:57.829+09:00">人們一定不去听它；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:22:05.163+09:00">有一种美色，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:22:21.444+09:00">眼睛看，背定惬意.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:22:40.164+09:00">但看了之后就使人失明.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:22:55.235+09:00">人們一定不去看它；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:23:02.709+09:00">有一种美味.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:23:11.307+09:00">口吃了肯定惬意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:23:49.505+09:00">住!吃了以后就使人变为哑巴，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:23:54.008+09:00">人們一定不去吃它：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:25:02.846+09:00">所以，聖人对于声色滋味</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:25:06.279+09:00">并有利于养性的就采用它；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:41:20.836+09:00">有害于养性的就設弃它：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:25:18.309+09:00">这是保全关性的办法。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:25:30.571+09:00">世上做大官的及富有的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:25:45.111+09:00">他行困于声色滋味多是城恋的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:25:55.556+09:00">日夜追求,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:26:22.132+09:00">一旦侥幸得到它,就沉醉在盘中。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:26:28.944+09:00">这样在声色湾味中，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:27:04.855+09:00">天性怎能不受到伤害呢？</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:27:37.019+09:00">万人拉开弓共同射一个"的* “的”</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:28:40.331+09:00">没冇不被射中的.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:41:54.749+09:00">众多的万物共同来</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:44:02.347+09:00">損害个生命.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:44:19.85+09:00">这个生命没有不被伤害的:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T00:44:38.716+09:00">万物共同来滋养一个生命.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T01:31:35.559+09:00">这个生命一定长寿。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:14:51.997+09:00">所以圣人驾馭物•</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:15:41.166+09:00">为的是保全人的天性.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:16:00.395+09:00">人的天行保全了,精神就和谐,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:16:04.893+09:00">眼睹就明亮</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:16:09.341+09:00">.耳朵就聪期</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:16:13.649+09:00">.嗅觉就載锐.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:16:22.521+09:00">味觉就灵敏,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:18:12.896+09:00">三百六十个关节就？利•</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:18:22.775+09:00">象这样的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:20:24.193+09:00">不用表白他自己有信用，人家都会相信他:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:20:33.103+09:00">不用去计谋他所做的事,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:21:57.372+09:00">不經思索也能采取正确的錯施:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:23:27.55+09:00">他的經气通于天地.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:23:31.767+09:00">他的神情达于宇宙：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:30:53.998+09:00">对事物没冇不网接受的,沒有不攏括的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:31:21.416+09:00">好象天无所不覆、地无所不载一样：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:32:36.09+09:00">这样的人，在上做天子而不驕傲，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:34:52.551+09:00">这样的人，在上做天子而不骄傲,在下当百姓也不忧闷：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-09T04:45:40.79+09:00">这种人叫做道德完美的人一.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
